From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fixture Developer <dev@mobimanual.local>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Give kiosk policies their own exit passcode

Leaving kiosk mode took the device passcode. The person using the device
usually knows it, so anyone could leave kiosk mode.

A kiosk policy now sets its own exit passcode, in a new field on the Kiosk
policy form. The device passcode no longer leaves kiosk mode.
---
Expected: worth documenting. Triage answers doc-impact. The draft corrects "Leaving kiosk mode requires the device passcode." on _policies_kiosk.md rather than only adding to it, adds a step for the **Exit passcode**, and flags screenshots/_kiosk_mode_1.png as possibly stale. _devicescommands.md and _policies_passcode.md also talk about the device passcode and stay unchanged.

